  "recorded": "'once' = relevant once per patient; 'repeatedly' = relevant at each moment listed",
  "likely_source": "Hackathon assumption about where the element usually lives today, to be checked per hospital. 'structured' = coded field in EHR, lab or prescribing system; 'report text' = inside a pathology, radiology or endoscopy report; 'MDT form' = recorded at the tumour board, often free text; 'patient / clinic note' = in clinic notes or from the patient; 'derived' = calculated from other elements."
